<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#al-WP-sparh> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#al-WP-sparh> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#Alignment> .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#al-WP-sparh> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Identical label in both frameworks; IDHEAS-G took the term from SPAR-H."@en .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#al-WP-sparh> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#externalFactor> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#sparh-WorkProcesses> .
