<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#al-WP-sparh> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#sourceRef> "gertman2005" .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-cream-TimeOfDay> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-cream-TimeOfDay> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#CoverageGap> .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-cream-TimeOfDay> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "No local factor represents time of day or circadian phase. IDHEAS-G has no such\nPIF either, so the gap is inherited rather than introduced. This is the gap that\nmatters most for shift-based occupational settings, and closing it would require\nan exposure denominator by hour of shift that no public dataset currently\nsupplies (Hanecke et al. 1998; Folkard and Tucker 2003)."@en .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-cream-TimeOfDay> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#sourceRef> "folkard2003" .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-cream-TimeOfDay> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#sourceRef> "hanecke1998" .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-cream-TimeOfDay> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#sourceRef> "hollnagel1998" .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-cream-TimeOfDay> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#uncoveredFactor> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#cream-TimeOfDay> .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hfacs-FailedToCorrectProblem> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hfacs-FailedToCorrectProblem> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#CoverageGap> .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hfacs-FailedToCorrectProblem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "No local factor represents a supervisor's failure to correct a known deficiency."@en .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hfacs-FailedToCorrectProblem> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#sourceRef> "shappell2000" .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hfacs-FailedToCorrectProblem> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#uncoveredFactor> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#hfacs-FailedToCorrectProblem> .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hfacs-PersonalReadiness> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hfacs-PersonalReadiness> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#CoverageGap> .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hfacs-PersonalReadiness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "No local factor represents personal readiness in the HFACS sense: an\nindividual's off-duty preparation for work, including rest, diet and compliance\nwith alcohol and self-medication rules. The gap is inherited rather than\nintroduced. IDHEAS-G has no fitness-for-duty PIF, whereas SPAR-H does, and the\ntwenty factors here are IDHEAS-G's twenty adopted unchanged. ehs:MentalFatigue\nis the nearest local factor and is deliberately not aligned to this one: fatigue\nis a state during the task, personal readiness is conduct before it, and one\ncauses the other rather than being it."@en .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hfacs-PersonalReadiness> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#sourceRef> "gertman2005" .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hfacs-PersonalReadiness> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#sourceRef> "nureg2198" .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hfacs-PersonalReadiness> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#sourceRef> "shappell2000" .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hfacs-PersonalReadiness> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#sourceRef> "shappell2006" .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hfacs-PersonalReadiness> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#uncoveredFactor> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#hfacs-PersonalReadiness> .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hfacs-SupervisoryViolations> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hfacs-SupervisoryViolations> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#CoverageGap> .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hfacs-SupervisoryViolations> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "No local factor represents wilful supervisory disregard of rules."@en .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hfacs-SupervisoryViolations> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#sourceRef> "shappell2000" .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hfacs-SupervisoryViolations> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#uncoveredFactor> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#hfacs-SupervisoryViolations> .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hse-Motivation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hse-Motivation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#CoverageGap> .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hse-Motivation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "No local factor represents motivation or competing priorities as an attribute of the individual."@en .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hse-Motivation> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#sourceRef> "hse_pifs" .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hse-Motivation> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#uncoveredFactor> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#hse-Motivation> .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hse-OrganisationalLearning> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hse-OrganisationalLearning> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#CoverageGap> .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hse-OrganisationalLearning> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "No local factor represents the effectiveness of organisational learning."@en .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hse-OrganisationalLearning> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#sourceRef> "hse_pifs" .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hse-OrganisationalLearning> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#uncoveredFactor> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#hse-OrganisationalLearning> .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hse-PeerPressure> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hse-PeerPressure> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#CoverageGap> .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hse-PeerPressure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "No local factor represents peer pressure. Team and organisation factors is too coarse to stand in for it."@en .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hse-PeerPressure> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#sourceRef> "hse_pifs" .
<https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#gap-hse-PeerPressure> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/ehs-hfo#uncoveredFactor> <https://priyatham9.github.io/ehs-human-factors-ontology/xwalk#hse-PeerPressure> .
